        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "b48ebc90-a0cb-5332-885f-912bdad355f6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kid Rock, Sheryl Crow, Allison Moorer\n- Products: Cocky, \"Picture\", \"Lonely Road of Faith\"\n- Companies: Atlantic, Crow's label\n- Topics: singles, duets, radio re-recordings, album releases\n\nFacts:\n- Kid Rock's 2001 album \"Cocky\" includes the ballad \"Picture\" as a duet with Sheryl Crow.\n- Atlantic was initially unable to obtain rights from Sheryl Crow's label to release the album version of \"Picture\" as a single.\n- Kid Rock re-recorded \"Picture\" for radio with Allison Moorer as an alternative country duet version.\n- \"Lonely Road of Faith\" was the second single released from Kid Rock's 2001 album \"Cocky\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
